<commits>
b851f55e59 descriptor: remove unused ctx parameter from InferXOnlyPubkey

989b62c34f fees: remove unused FeeCalculation::best_height

It is written but never read.

1c5b36bf1e serialize: remove unused GetSizeOfVarInt

ff3585fe31 ui: remove unused CClientUIInterface::ICON_MASK

5d80156f4e util: remove unused TokenBucket clock and duration aliases

70648fa318 util: remove unused util::insert overloads

The only caller, in wallet/coinselection.h, inserts into a std::set with
a custom comparator, so only the std::set<TsetT, Compare> overload is
ever selected.

fbdc16ff07 serialize: remove unused unique_ptr<const T> serialization

37c4df1130 policy: remove unused STANDARD_NOT_MANDATORY_VERIFY_FLAGS

30a8a87280 rpc: remove write-only input_txos from scantxoutset

45620064a1 wallet: remove unused CoinsResult::TypesCount

