625c97f6b5 ui: remove unused CClientUIInterface::SECURE flag

8ed5de2f4e rest: remove no-op InterruptREST

8765595f45 torcontrol: remove commented-out cookie AUTHENTICATE command

9742479ef5 net: remove unused const CConnman::ForEachNode overload

67f9ff8320 qt: remove unused RPCConsole::cachedNodeids

f8b10695bd wallet: remove unused last_client parameter from LoadLegacyWalletRecords

5935ae60a8 qt: remove unused couldSignInputs psbtx parameter
